      <figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1782671988047-0d1064a1ebcd?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=85" alt="전자기기 내부 부품"><figcaption>정밀 부착</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1774638900399-e5fcec47e4d5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=85" alt="재료 시험기"><figcaption>샘플 테스트</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
    <div class="proofSteps"><span><b>01</b> 후보 선정</span><span><b>02</b> 샘플 테스트</span></div>
