    <article><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1602052577122-f73b9710adba?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80" alt="시험 장비"><span>03</span><b>샘플 테스트</b><p>실사용 조건에 맞춘 검증</p></article>
    <article><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1644079446600-219068676743?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80" alt="물류 창고"><span>04</span><b>견적·주문</b><p>규격·수량·납기 확인 후 발주</p></article>
