<section id="consult" class="section consultSec">
  <div class="sectionHead"><p class="eyebrow">01 TECHNICAL CONSULTING</p><h2>무엇을 붙이려고 하시나요?</h2><p>복잡한 품번 대신 실제 사용조건을 입력하세요.</p></div>
  <div class="consultGrid">
    <form class="wizard" id="consultForm">
      <div class="consultStatus"><span>현재 입력 조건</span><b id="consultSummary">소재와 사용환경을 선택해주세요.</b></div>
      <div class="wizardProgress"><span class="active">소재</span><span>환경</span><span>성능</span><span>규격</span></div>
      <div class="formGrid two"><label>첫 번째 소재<select id="materialA"><option value="">선택</option></select></label><label>두 번째 소재<select id="materialB"><option value="">선택</option></select></label></div>
      <div class="choiceBlock"><b>사용환경</b><div class="chips" data-name="environment"><button type="button">실내</button><button type="button">실외</button><button type="button">고온</button><button type="button">저온</button><button type="button">습기·방수</button><button type="button">진동·충격</button></div></div>
      <div class="choiceBlock"><b>필요한 성능</b><div class="chips multi" data-name="performance"><button type="button">고점착</button><button type="button">얇은 두께</button><button type="button">재작업성</button><button type="button">내열</button><button type="button">절연</button><button type="button">방열</button><button type="button">마스킹</button><button type="button">표면보호</button></div></div>
      <div class="formGrid three"><label>희망 폭<input id="wishWidth" placeholder="예: 20mm"></label><label>희망 길이<input id="wishLength" placeholder="예: 50m"></label><label>예상 수량<input id="wishQty" placeholder="예: 월 100롤"></label></div>
      <div class="consultActions"><button class="btn primary full" type="submit">조건에 맞는 테이프 추천받기</button><button class="btn light full" type="button" id="saveConsult">상담 조건 저장</button></div>
    </form>
    <aside class="consultAside photoAside"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1603901622056-0a5bee231395?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=85" alt="기술 도면과 제도 도구"><div class="asideCopy"><p class="eyebrow light">현장 조건 중심 상담</p><h3>제품 하나보다<br>사용조건 전체를 봅니다.</h3><ul><li>피착재의 표면에너지와 상태</li><li>온도·습도·옥외 노출 조건</li><li>필요 두께와 가공 규격</li><li>초기점착과 장기접착 요구</li></ul></div></aside>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="industryGallery">
  <div class="sectionHead centered"><p class="eyebrow">REAL APPLICATION AREAS</p><h2>산업별 현장과 적용 부위를 기준으로 찾습니다.</h2></div>
  <div class="galleryGrid">
    <a href="#finder" class="galleryCard"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1777642328916-d96fc156f32b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85" alt="자동차 생산 라인"><span>자동차</span><small>내장재·하네스·부품 고정</small></a>
    <a href="#finder" class="galleryCard"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518770660439-4636190af475?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85" alt="전자 회로"><span>전자·PCB</span><small>절연·방열·정밀 부착</small></a>
    <a href="#finder" class="galleryCard"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509391366360-2e959784a276?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85" alt="태양광 설비"><span>에너지</span><small>내후성·실링·고정</small></a>
    <a href="#finder" class="galleryCard"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1740209475472-aa7d280f7452?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85" alt="산업 가공 설비"><span>산업기기</span><small>조립·진동·충격 대응</small></a>
  </div>
</section>


